  "summary": {
    "zh": "按公司代码、年度和期间执行 FI/CO/MM/SD 月结检查，汇总异常、数据缺口、阻塞项和可追踪待办。",
    "en": "Runs FI/CO/MM/SD closing checks by company, year and period, then reports findings, data gaps, blockers and traceable tasks."
  },
  "status": "Three-stage live acceptance passed",
  "version": "0.1.0",
